  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Electromagnetic-Weather Modification</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Photon_-_Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_Marvel.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150326043002\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Photon - Genis-Vell (Earth-616) Marvel\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Photon_-_Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_Marvel.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20150326043002\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Photon_-_Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_Marvel.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20150326043002 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Photon_-_Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_Marvel.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150326043002 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Photon - Genis-Vell (Earth-616) Marvel\" width=\"270\" height=\"360\" data-image-key=\"Photon_-_Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_Marvel.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Photon - Genis-Vell (Earth-616) Marvel.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Genis-Vell/Photon (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it to weather alteration.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it towards weather alteration</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Weather Manipulation\">Weather Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Weather_Modification%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it towards altering the weather in any way possible.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Weather_Modification%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Weather Manipulation\">Bio-Weather Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Air_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Air Manipulation\">Bio-Air Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electricity_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Electricity Manipulation\">Bio-Electricity Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermal_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermal Manipulation\">Bio-Thermal Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Water_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Water Manipulation\">Bio-Water Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Energizing\" title=\"Electromagnetic Energizing\">Electromagnetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Electromagnetic Absorption\">Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Weather\" title=\"Personal Weather\">Personal Weather</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Weather Manipulation\">Weather Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Manipulation\" title=\"Air Manipulation\">Air Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tornado_Manipulation\" title=\"Tornado Manipulation\">Tornado Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Atmosphere_Manipulation\" title=\"Atmosphere Manipulation\">Atmosphere Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Atmospheric_Adaptation\" title=\"Atmospheric Adaptation\">Atmospheric Adaptation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Atmosphere_Creation\" title=\"Atmosphere Creation\">Atmosphere Creation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cloud_Manipulation\" title=\"Cloud Manipulation\">Cloud Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cloud_Manipulation\" title=\"Ice Cloud Manipulation\">Ice Cloud Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thundercloud_Manipulation\" title=\"Thundercloud Manipulation\">Thundercloud Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Manipulation\" title=\"Electricity Manipulation\">Electricity Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Manipulation\" title=\"Lightning Manipulation\">Lightning Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Manipulation\" title=\"Thermal Manipulation\">Thermal Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Manipulation\" title=\"Water Manipulation\">Water Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rain_Manipulation\" title=\"Rain Manipulation\">Rain Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Manipulation\" title=\"Snow Manipulation\">Snow Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Weather_Modification\" title=\"Radiative-Weather Modification\">Radiative-Weather Modification</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Weather_Modification%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Weather_Modification%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much electromagnetic energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers, <a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Weather Manipulation\">Weather Manipulation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Manipulation\">Electromagnetism Manipulation</a> can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in environments that lack energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Weather_Modification%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Richard_Redditch_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Richard Redditch (New Earth)\">Richard Redditch/The Artist</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Genis-Vell_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Genis-Vell (Earth-616)\">Genis-Vell/Photon</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://toarumajutsunoindex.fandom.com/wiki/Electromaster\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:toarumajutsunoindex:Electromaster\">Electromasters</a> (<i>Toaru Majutsu no Index - Toaru Kagaku no Railgun/A Certain Magical Index - A Certain Scientific Railgun]]</i></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Jon_Farmer_(Wildstorm_Universe)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Jon Farmer (Wildstorm Universe)\">Jon Farmer/The Transdimensional Man</a> (<i>Wildstorm Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260805182416\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 123/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 73/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.957      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.957      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:520165-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260805182416 and revision id 2395378. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
